:name: nRF52840
:description: Runs a Zephyr ELF on Renode's nRF52840 model, with UART0 in the log.
:
: $elf has to be set before this script is included, as an absolute path, so
: the same script works from any directory. From apps/10-renode:
:
:   renode --console --disable-xwt -e "\$elf=@$PWD/build/zephyr/zephyr.elf; include @run_nrf52.resc"
:
: With --disable-xwt there is no window to open, so showAnalyzer writes each
: UART line into Renode's log instead, tagged "uart0:".

mach create "nrf52840"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl

showAnalyzer uart0

sysbus LoadELF $elf

start
